<title>USA: Kohl's to open 21 stores in spring 1997.</title>
<headline>Kohl's to open 21 stores in spring 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MENOMONEE FALLS, Wis. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kohl's Corp said Friday it plans to open 21 stores in the spring of 1997, including entries into the Washington, D.C., Baltimore and Philadelphia markets.</p>
<p>About 3,150 full-time and part-time positions will be created by the opening of these 21 stores, with hiring efforts to begin after the new year, department store operator Kohl's said.</p>
<p>Kohl's plans a total of 22 store openings in 1996 and plans a total of 25-30 store openings in 1997, Kohl's said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
